WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.522
"What?" Zann's hand flew to his forehead. The purple marks were gone!

2
00:00:05.523 --> 00:00:10.034
"Maybe we can get them back with a Restore spell," Perda suggested.

3
00:00:10.035 --> 00:00:14.022
"But we haven't learned those yet," protested Gliss.

4
00:00:14.023 --> 00:00:20.719
"So what? It's worth a try." Perda rubbed her hands together. "Restore!"

5
00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:24.411
Zann stared at her hopefully. "Well?"

6
00:00:24.412 --> 00:00:29.174
"Nothing." Perda's shoulders slumped. "Sorry, guys."

7
00:00:29.175 --> 00:00:32.742
Darb shaded his eyes. "Look, someone's coming."

8
00:00:32.743 --> 00:00:39.912
A woman was walking toward them. She was blue-skinned and bald, with a pretty, smiling face.

9
00:00:39.913 --> 00:00:43.334
"Hello," she greeted them. "My name is Vee.

10
00:00:43.335 --> 00:00:46.472
I am the guardian of the wormhole."

11
00:00:46.473 --> 00:00:50.203
"Why does this wormhole need a guardian?" Perda asked.

12
00:00:50.204 --> 00:00:53.547
"We've had some trouble lately," Vee replied.

13
00:00:53.548 --> 00:00:56.434
"What kind of trouble?" said Gliss.

14
00:00:56.435 --> 00:01:00.279
"The details aren't important." Vee was still smiling.

15
00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:03.522
"What brings you young people to Pax?"

16
00:01:03.523 --> 00:01:07.232
"Pax? Is that the name of this world?"

17
00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:11.634
Zann didn't remember ever hearing his parents mention a world by that name.

18
00:01:11.635 --> 00:01:14.190
Perda didn't seem to recognize it either.

19
00:01:14.191 --> 00:01:17.758
That meant it probably wasn't in any of his parents' books.

20
00:01:17.759 --> 00:01:20.926
"We're looking for two people," Gliss said.

21
00:01:20.927 --> 00:01:25.165
"A woman named Wyssa and a man named Morb."

22
00:01:25.166 --> 00:01:29.659
Vee gasped, her pleasant expression turning fearful.

23
00:01:29.660 --> 00:01:35.342
"Why are you looking for Morb? Are you friends of his?"

24
00:01:35.343 --> 00:01:39.693
"No way!" Perda exclaimed. "Morb is evil."

25
00:01:39.694 --> 00:01:46.141
Vee looked relieved. "Yes, we know. He's the reason I was sent to guard the wormhole."

26
00:01:46.142 --> 00:01:49.109
"So he was here recently?" Zann asked.

27
00:01:49.110 --> 00:01:54.837
Vee nodded. "He visited Pax just long enough to steal a mibbit."

28
00:01:54.838 --> 00:01:58.177
"A mibbit?" said Darb. "What's that?"

29
00:01:58.178 --> 00:02:02.569
"One of our most cherished creatures," Vee said.

30
00:02:02.570 --> 00:02:08.569
"Mibbits have very strong and specific magic, and they're prone to panic.

31
00:02:08.570 --> 00:02:14.984
When they panic, they send out powerful energy that overwhelms anyone nearby.

32
00:02:14.985 --> 00:02:20.005
Victims are unable to think or act or even move."

33
00:02:20.006 --> 00:02:23.901
Zann and the others exchanged concerned glances.

34
00:02:23.902 --> 00:02:27.699
"Uh-oh, that doesn't sound good," Perda said.

35
00:02:27.700 --> 00:02:33.109
"I bet Morb wants the mibbit to help him try to take over Magica again."

36
00:02:33.110 --> 00:02:36.719
Vee looked confused. "What are you talking about?"

37
00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:39.535
Zann quickly told her the whole story.

38
00:02:39.536 --> 00:02:45.381
"So that's why we're afraid that Morb might be gathering power again," he finished.

39
00:02:45.382 --> 00:02:49.451
"Maybe Morb is trying to force my parents to help him."

40
00:02:49.452 --> 00:02:55.293
"Then again, maybe Morb isn't interested in Magica anymore," Darb suggested.

41
00:02:55.294 --> 00:02:58.264
"Your parents know a lot about other worlds, right?

42
00:02:58.265 --> 00:03:03.559
Maybe Morb is planning to use their knowledge to take over a different world this time."

43
00:03:03.560 --> 00:03:08.568
"Like this one, maybe?" Gliss glanced around at the beautiful scenery.

44
00:03:08.569 --> 00:03:15.691
"It's really nice here. And Morb knows the mibbit's magic would definitely work on the people of Pax."

45
00:03:15.692 --> 00:03:20.531
"Or maybe he wants to take over World X," Zann said.

46
00:03:20.532 --> 00:03:23.174
"That could be why he's after my parents.

47
00:03:23.175 --> 00:03:25.427
He wants them to lead him there!"

48
00:03:25.428 --> 00:03:28.431
"That makes sense," Perda agreed.

49
00:03:28.432 --> 00:03:37.991
"If it's true that World X is some kind of gateway to all other worlds, controlling World X could give Morb incredible power."

50
00:03:37.992 --> 00:03:46.860
"Oh dear," Vee said. "I fear the powers of our sweet mibbit could help Morb take over any world."

51
00:03:46.861 --> 00:03:50.492
"How did he capture it, if it's that powerful?" Darb asked.

52
00:03:50.493 --> 00:03:58.950
Vee looked nervous. "We don't know. It would take unimaginable power to immobilize a mibbit without panicking it."

53
00:03:58.951 --> 00:04:02.824
"We really need to catch up to Wyssa now," Perda said.

54
00:04:02.825 --> 00:04:05.817
"We have to warn her about this!"

55
00:04:05.818 --> 00:04:12.421
"You're right. I don't think she realizes just how much power Morb must have now," Zann said.

56
00:04:12.422 --> 00:04:15.375
"Plus she doesn't know about the mibbit."

57
00:04:15.376 --> 00:04:18.625
"But how will we find Wyssa?" Gliss asked.

58
00:04:18.626 --> 00:04:21.914
"We've lost our only way of tracking her."

59
00:04:21.915 --> 00:04:28.064
Zann turned to Vee. "Do you know of any magic that could help us track someone through the vortex?"

60
00:04:28.065 --> 00:04:34.974
"I'm afraid not," Vee said. "Paxian magic is quite different from that of many other worlds.

61
00:04:34.975 --> 00:04:40.289
It mostly involves feelings and communications, not physical abilities."

62
00:04:40.290 --> 00:04:46.188
"Really? But you guys must be able to do the basic stuff, right?" Perda asked.

63
00:04:46.189 --> 00:04:51.744
"Like conjuring food, performing Blast spells, or building houses by magic?"

64
00:04:51.745 --> 00:04:55.966
"No, we can't do any of that." Vee sighed.

65
00:04:55.967 --> 00:05:01.857
"That's why Morb was able to overpower us so easily and steal the mibbit."

66
00:05:01.858 --> 00:05:10.646
"Wow." Zann glanced at the distant city on the hill, awed to think that it had been built entirely without magic.

67
00:05:10.647 --> 00:05:17.543
"That reminds me," Vee went on. "I should let my people know what you've just told me about Morb.

68
00:05:17.544 --> 00:05:20.508
Pardon me while I send them a mind message."

69
00:05:20.509 --> 00:05:23.414
"A mind message?" Gliss echoed.

70
00:05:23.415 --> 00:05:26.589
"It's a kind of telepathy," Vee explained.

71
00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:31.476
"We can all communicate within our minds anytime we wish."

72
00:05:31.477 --> 00:05:35.295
"Cool," Zann said. "Too bad we can't do that!"

73
00:05:35.296 --> 00:05:42.322
Perda smiled. "Yeah. It would save a lot of time, not having to inscribe message moths."

74
00:05:42.323 --> 00:05:46.611
Vee closed her eyes. "I'll just be a moment . . ."

75
00:05:46.612 --> 00:05:51.953
While Zann waited, he pulled out his message stone and stared at it helplessly.

76
00:05:51.954 --> 00:05:55.186
How could he find his parents before Morb did?

77
00:05:55.187 --> 00:05:58.730
"What's that?" Vee asked when she opened her eyes.

78
00:05:58.731 --> 00:06:05.006
Zann explained about message stones. "This one holds a message from my parents," he finished.

79
00:06:05.007 --> 00:06:08.072
"Too bad it can't tell us where they are now."

80
00:06:08.073 --> 00:06:16.215
Vee smiled. "Perhaps I can help. All objects hold psychic traces of the people who last held them.

81
00:06:16.216 --> 00:06:20.626
I might be able to read your stone—if you want me to."

82
00:06:20.627 --> 00:06:25.727
"Really? That would be great!" Zann handed her the stone.

83
00:06:25.728 --> 00:06:28.430
Vee took it and closed her eyes.

84
00:06:28.431 --> 00:06:35.803
"The vision is faint, but I see two people: a man and a woman . . ." She quickly described them.

85
00:06:35.804 --> 00:06:41.075
"That's them!" Zann cried. "My parents! What else can you see?"

86
00:06:41.076 --> 00:06:49.935
"They're in a forest," Vee said. "They're surrounded by tiny people—the people don't even come up to your parents' knees."

87
00:06:49.936 --> 00:07:00.049
Zann gasped. "World X! I knew it—my parents must be in World X!"

